Chudik-Georgiadis restricted MFDL: direct regression of the monthly outcome on event-day shocks (no financial channel imposed)
Response at a horizon of h months = knot value theta_h (daily response h*21.7 weekdays after the event; comparable to month t+h in the VAR)
Units: pp of the unemployment gap, or % of the core PCE price level, per +1 pp window move in the 2-year (NS, NS-GB) or funds rate (MP1); 90% = 1.645 HAC se

